This file marks a Flathub-managed Armada build.

Its presence at resources/ARMADA_FLATHUB_BUILD inside the packaged app tells
electron/main.js that updates are owned by Flathub, so the app disables every
self-update path (electron-updater AND the Flatpak update portal). The contents
are ignored; only the file's existence matters.

See the update gate in electron/main.js.
